Answer:

Step 1

Run:

sql
EXPLAIN ANALYZE
SELECT *
FROM orders
WHERE customer_id = 1001;

Look for:

Seq Scan
Index Scan
Bitmap Heap Scan
Nested Loop
Hash Join
Sort
Actual Rows
Estimated Rows
Execution Time

Example:

Seq Scan on orders
(actual time=0.1..850.3 rows=100)

If the table contains millions of rows, this could indicate missing/ineffective indexing.


